{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>CoachFit 是一款注重私隱的健身訓練應用，會按用戶的目標、經驗、可用器材與當日恢復情況編排合適課表，適合想在家、出差或健身房按計劃訓練的人。原價 US $3.99，現正限時免費，一次下載即可使用，沒有廣告，也沒有訂閱收費。</p>\n\n<h2>按目標與器材編排課表</h2>\n<p>內建數百種動作，涵蓋力量、心肺、活動度、瑜伽、伸展、徒手、健美與塑形等類型。用戶可設定訓練長度、重點與器材，並加入熱身、體能或緩和環節，系統會編排完整課表供事前檢視。訓練時可記錄次數、負重、用力程度與完成組數，使用休息計時器並查看動作歷史，隨時加入或替換動作。所有資料只存於手機，可選擇與 Apple 健康分享。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-51-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-52-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-53-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-54-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-55-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-56-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：CoachFit</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T09:19:59.974689+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}